---
import LegalLayout from "../components/LegalLayout.astro";
import Fact from "../components/Fact.astro";
import { SUBPROCESSORS, CUSTOMER_CONNECTED_SERVICES, COMPANY } from "../config/legal";

// Rows come from src/config/legal.ts SUBPROCESSORS -- update the list there.
const t = {
  en: { vendor: "Vendor", purpose: "Purpose", data: "Data processed", location: "Location", transfer: "Transfer mechanism" },
  no: { vendor: "Leverandør", purpose: "Formål", data: "Opplysninger", location: "Plassering", transfer: "Overføringsgrunnlag" },
};
---

<LegalLayout
  doc="subprocessors"
  titleKey="SUBPROCESSORS"
  description="The third-party service providers Mielikkix uses to process personal data, what they do, where they are and on what transfer basis."
>
  <Fragment slot="en">
    <section>
      <p>
        These are the service providers (subprocessors) that process personal data on our behalf. We give each one only
        the data it needs, and each is bound by a data processing agreement. Customers with a
        {" "}<a href="/dpa">Data Processing Agreement</a> will be told before we add or replace a subprocessor. To be
        notified, email <a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.privacyEmail}`}>{COMPANY.privacyEmail}</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>{t.en.vendor}</th><th>{t.en.purpose}</th><th>{t.en.data}</th><th>{t.en.location}</th><th>{t.en.transfer}</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {SUBPROCESSORS.map((s) => (
              <tr>
                <td><strong>{s.name}</strong></td>
                <td>{s.purpose.en}</td>
                <td>{s.data.en}</td>
                <td><Fact value={s.location} /></td>
                <td><Fact value={s.transfer} /></td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Services a business connects itself</h2>
      <p>
        If a business connects its own account with one of these services, data flows between Mielikkix and that
        account on the business's instructions. They are the business's own providers, not our subprocessors:
      </p>
      <ul>{CUSTOMER_CONNECTED_SERVICES.map((s) => <li>{s}</li>)}</ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>On our own website</h2>
      <p>
        Google Analytics (Google Ireland Ltd / Google LLC) runs on mielikkix.ai only if you accept analytics cookies. See
        the <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </Fragment>

  <Fragment slot="no">
    <section>
      <p>
        Dette er tjenesteleverandørene (underleverandørene) som behandler personopplysninger på våre vegne. Hver av dem
        får bare de opplysningene de trenger, og alle er bundet av en databehandleravtale. Kunder med en
        {" "}<a href="/dpa">databehandleravtale</a> varsles før vi legger til eller bytter en underleverandør. Send e-post til
        {" "}<a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.privacyEmail}`}>{COMPANY.privacyEmail}</a> for å få varsler.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>{t.no.vendor}</th><th>{t.no.purpose}</th><th>{t.no.data}</th><th>{t.no.location}</th><th>{t.no.transfer}</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {SUBPROCESSORS.map((s) => (
              <tr>
                <td><strong>{s.name}</strong></td>
                <td>{s.purpose.no}</td>
                <td>{s.data.no}</td>
                <td><Fact value={s.location} /></td>
                <td><Fact value={s.transfer} /></td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Tjenester en bedrift kobler til selv</h2>
      <p>
        Hvis en bedrift kobler sin egen konto hos en av disse tjenestene til Mielikkix, går data mellom Mielikkix og den
        kontoen etter bedriftens instrukser. De er bedriftens egne leverandører, ikke våre underleverandører:
      </p>
      <ul>{CUSTOMER_CONNECTED_SERVICES.map((s) => <li>{s}</li>)}</ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>På vårt eget nettsted</h2>
      <p>
        Google Analytics (Google Ireland Ltd / Google LLC) kjører på mielikkix.ai bare hvis du godtar
        analyse-informasjonskapsler. Se <a href="/cookies">Informasjonskapsler</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </Fragment>
</LegalLayout>
